### Test CaseFormatConverter with existing test cases
### Validates v2-hierarchical → case.json v1.0 conversion

### 1. Test without caseId (shows usage)
GET http://localhost:7071/api/TestConverter
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Test with CASE-20260102-e6dcc658 (3 suspects, 11 docs, 12 media)
GET http://localhost:7071/api/TestConverter?caseId=CASE-20260102-e6dcc658
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Test with CASE-20251027-b442dc10 (second test case)
GET http://localhost:7071/api/TestConverter?caseId=CASE-20251027-b442dc10
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Test with CASE-20260102-1f17e3f1 (NEW CASE - just generated)
